<p>ICSE (2024–2027); FSE (2025–2027; Industry: 2022–2026; Ideas, Visions and Reflections: 2021); ISSTA (2024–2027); ASE (2025–2026); The Web Conference (2027); AAAI (2026); EASE (2026); APSEC (2024); Internetware (2023, 2024, 2026); ICSME Industry (2022); ICSS (2026); AIware (2025); CCF ChinaSoft (2025); SocialMeta (2023); Scala (2022); COLING (2022); ECOOP Doctoral Symposium (2019).</p>
